    "text": "As,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;lies in the plane of the vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>,&nbsp;So,&nbsp;<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Compare with <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Not in option<br />So, now consider <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#956;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+